  "description": "The Double Peak 29 Comp features a low stand over, low center of gravity frame made of X6 series alloy with internal head tube and internal cable routing. The \"DP\" Comp features a lightweight and versatile 1x10 Shimano Deore drive train with an FSA Comet 30T crankset. The 29\" Weinmann U-28 alloy wheelset is fitted with efficient Kenda Honey badger 29\" x 2.2\" tires. The front end features an upgraded Suntour XCM 100mm fork with hydraulic lockout. A very capable X-Country performance bike, the Comp flies but always lands safely thanks to its Shimano MT-201 Hydraulic disc brake set.\nDouble Peak 6000 Series alloy frame w/ internal routing\nSuntour XCM NLO 100mm travel fork w/ HLO & Rebound damping\nFSA Comet Modular 1x 30t crankset\nShimano Deore 6000 rear derailleur & shifter\nShimano Deore 10-spd 11-42T cassette\nWTB Werewolf grips and Volt Sport saddle\nKenda Honey Badger XC 29\" x2.2\" tires\nWeinmann U-28 Disc alloy DW rims, 28H\nNew Shimano MT-201 hydraulic disc brakeset, Center Lock\nShimano RM35 hubs with QR, 28H",
